Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\be5\1c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fn@更紗黑體 TC\frz270\pos(1456.5,496.5)\fad(600,500)}茫然隨波流
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\be5\1c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fn@更紗黑體 TC\frz270\pos(1359,678)\fad(600,500)}情路亦如斯
